                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "903f459a-e925-3ee5-b49f-9fc07ffc9a57",
                                        "entry_id": "e1d1dc68-d01a-33a1-ba8a-5dcce7eb771f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who twerks."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "876e283d-993b-4cf0-b7d3-4cc9ef3b2f09",
                                                "sense_id": "903f459a-e925-3ee5-b49f-9fc07ffc9a57",
                                                "text": "And some of the songs are good at least for a few laughs, including \"Booty Meat,\" in which Soulja Boy demands all the boppers, twerkers and the like \"shake that booty meat,\" over and over."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71fb725f-fdbf-40fa-839e-3abb1925b4ba",
                                                "sense_id": "903f459a-e925-3ee5-b49f-9fc07ffc9a57",
                                                "text": "It will bring her back into the Disney fold as an adult and perhaps enable her to find a healthy balance between her warring halves - the publicity-seeking twerker and, somewhere still inside, the charming Smiley Miley Cyrus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6cb72d2-806c-4523-8801-7f176584d874",
                                                "sense_id": "903f459a-e925-3ee5-b49f-9fc07ffc9a57",
                                                "text": "It may be the hot dance craze of the moment, but one hapless young twerker appears to take things a little too far when she literally sets herself on fire in the middle of a raunchy routine."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
